  ('scmp', 'South China Morning Post', 'Global AI experts push back on US ‘distillation’ claims against Moonshot’s Kimi K3 model', 'https://www.scmp.com/tech/tech-war/article/3361625/global-ai-experts-push-back-us-distillation-claims-against-moonshots-kimi-k3-model?utm_source=rss_feed', 'The global AI community has pushed back against the Trump administration’s claims that Moonshot AI’s groundbreaking Kimi K3 distilled US models, citing a lack of justification and arguing that the practice does not constitute intellectual property theft. In separate posts on X on Thursday, a number of AI experts called the accusations “political” and “reckless”, pointing out that an AI model’s output was not copyrighted. A Moonshot employee on Thursday hit back at the US officials’ claims that..', '2026-07-23 12:30:11+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
  ('scmp', 'South China Morning Post', 'The dangerous illusion that AI understands, thinks and cares', 'https://www.scmp.com/opinion/world-opinion/article/3361251/dangerous-illusion-ai-understands-thinks-and-cares?utm_source=rss_feed', 'Anthropomorphising artificial intelligence – that is, treating AI systems as though they possess human emotions, intentions, consciousness or moral judgment – is both an ethical and a practical problem. While attributing human qualities to AI systems may make interactions more approachable, it also risks clouding users’ perceptions of the technology’s true nature and limitations. Call a spade a spade. The so-called hallucinations that generative AI systems produce are nothing more than errors...', '2026-07-23 12:30:06+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
