  ('democracynow', 'Democracy Now!', '"Enough Is Enough": Mohsen Mahdawi Says New Deportation Threat Seeks to Silence Palestine Activism', 'http://www.democracynow.org/2026/7/23/mohsen_mahdawi', 'Palestinian activist Mohsen Mahdawi, whose arrest by masked and hooded ICE agents when he arrived for his naturalization interview to become a U.S. citizen made national headlines last year, is facing a new deportation threat after a three-judge panel overturned a lower court ruling that had freed him from ICE custody. Mahdawi was involved in pro-Palestine protests at Columbia University, where he was a student, demandin', '2026-07-23 12:26:46+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
