  ('timesofindia', 'Times of India', 'Margot Robbie secretly splashes $28m on a Queensland ranch estate', 'https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/margot-robbie-secretly-splashes-28m-on-a-queensland-ranch-estate-with-horse-stables-pool-tennis-court-and-10-car-garage/articleshow/132574988.cms', 'Margot Robbie has made headlines with her recent acquisition of a lavish estate in Queensland, costing $28 million. Nestled in the scenic Currumbin Valley, this property holds significant nostalgia for the actress, as it''s near where she grew up. After leaving the Gold Coast in her youth to chase her acting ambitions, this return represe', '2026-07-23 07:54:43+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
  ('scmp', 'South China Morning Post', 'Japan’s deadliest fault line shifts, frustrating megaquake forecasts', 'https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/health-environment/article/3361572/japans-deadliest-fault-line-shifts-frustrating-megaquake-forecasts?utm_source=rss_feed', 'A Japanese study has found that the locked zone in the Nankai Trough is not permanent but changes over time, further complicating the task of predicting megaquakes along the fault line. A locked zone is where tectonic plates merge, allowing stress to build up until it is released in an earthquake. In the case of the 900km (560-mile) long Nankai Trough off Japan’s Pacific coast, it is where the Philippine plate meets the Eurasian plate. The Philippine plate is slipping under the Eurasian plate at', '2026-07-23 07:46:19+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
