  ('scmp', 'South China Morning Post', 'Chinese investors rush into private funds, pouring US$1.2 trillion into securities', 'https://www.scmp.com/business/banking-finance/article/3361488/chinese-investors-rush-private-funds-pouring-us12-trillion-securities?utm_source=rss_feed', 'China’s private securities investment funds surpassed 8 trillion yuan (US$1.2 trillion) for the first time at the end of June, emerging as the core engine driving the expansion of the country’s private fund industry, according to the Asset Management Association of China. Propelled by the huge growth in securities funds, assets under management in the broader private fund industry hit a record 23.66 trillion yuan, the association said. The sector has achieved record-breaking asset levels for 12.', '2026-07-23 00:00:16+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
