  ('democracynow', 'Democracy Now!', '"Completely Unprecedented": Ari Berman on Trump''s Attack on Elections Ahead of Midterms', 'http://www.democracynow.org/2026/7/14/elections_ari_berman', 'We get an update on elections and voting rights in the United States from Mother Jones''s national voting rights correspondent, Ari Berman, who warns of President Donald Trump''s escalating attempts to “try to claim dictatorial power” and commit an “unprecedented intervention” into the 2026 midterm elections. Whether it takes the form of claims of foreign interference, canceling mail-in voting or requiring proof of citize', '2026-07-14 12:51:30+00', 'Read-only reference import: public source metadata only. No original body text, embeddings, entities, claims, or relationship data were copied.', '[]'::jsonb, false, false, false, 'v2-original-reference-news-2026-08-19', 'active', 'Copied only from the original platform’s public article metadata in a read-only reference pass; source URL retained for verification. No original database relationship or private metadata was imported.'),
